Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.13,0:00:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Open the borderless map{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.13,0:00:13.97,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}mugendai no chizu hiroge{\i0}
