Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.01,0:00:16.93,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}hateshinai ano basho e{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.97,0:00:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's sail on, raise high the sails{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.97,0:00:21.52,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's sail on takaku ho wo agete{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.56,0:00:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Catch the wind{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.56,0:00:24.27,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}kaze ni nore{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.90,0:00:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't give up, if I'm determined{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.90,0:00:33.78,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't give up kakugo kimetano nara{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.82,0:00:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll never turn back{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.82,0:00:37.03,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}hikikaeshi wa shinai sa{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.07,0:00:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Laugh on through troubled waters{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.07,0:00:40.33,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}waraitobase aranami{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.58,0:00:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Shout it out, to save \Nyour spirit from breaking{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.58,0:00:45.12,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Shout it out kokoro kudakenai youni{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.16,0:00:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Your friends are there for you{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.16,0:00:47.58,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}nakama ga irun da{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.62,0:00:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey, you don't ever need to act tough{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.62,0:00:54.01,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}hora tsuyogari nante iranai itsudatte{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.05,0:00:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even when the darkness \Ntries to tear you apart{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.05,0:00:58.09,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}yami ga hikisakou toshitemo{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.14,0:00:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Come on, brave it out{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.14,0:00:59.39,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}hora Brave it out{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.43,0:01:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's going to be all right{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.43,0:01:00.89,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}daijoubu sa{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.93,0:01:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Strong bonds will break through{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.93,0:01:04.60,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}uchiyaburu saikyo no kizuna{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Open the borderless map{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:07.35,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}mugendai no chizu hiroge{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.39,0:01:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Towards the place that has no end{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.39,0:01:10.56,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}hateshinai ano basho e{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.61,0:01:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Have the courage to take a step forward{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.61,0:01:16.07,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}fumidase yuuki no ippo{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.11,0:01:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Open the borderless map{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.11,0:01:18.78,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}mugendai no chizu hiroge{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.82,0:01:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The flag that called forth oaths{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.82,0:01:21.49,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}chikai atsumeta hata{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.49,0:01:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Keep fighting on{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.49,0:01:24.24,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}tatakai tsudukete iku{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.29,0:01:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stay true to yourself{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.29,0:01:29.00,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"jibunjishin" tsuranuke{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.04,0:01:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Seize it, dreamin' on{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.04,0:01:33.34,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}tsukami toru Dreamin' on{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.75,0:01:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't lose, I'll never run away{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.75,0:01:38.72,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}makerarenai nige ya shinai{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.39,0:01:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Transcend meetings and \Npartings and keep going{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.39,0:01:42.22,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}deai wakare koe ikou{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.26,0:01:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're all treasures{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.26,0:01:46.56,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}zenbu takaramono{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.98,0:01:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Open the borderless map{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.98,0:01:49.77,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}mugendai no chizu hiroge{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.81,0:01:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Towards the place that has no end{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.81,0:01:52.90,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}hateshinai ano basho e{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.94,0:01:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Have the courage to take a step forward{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.94,0:01:57.61,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}fumidase yuuki no ippo{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.65,0:02:01.78,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}ko wo agete{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.65,0:02:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Raise your fist{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.92,0:02:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I am worried to death about Otoko...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.09,0:02:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,but still, Kawamatsu,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.47,0:02:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not going to meet everyone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.72,0:02:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,People should not get \Nemotional before battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.44,0:02:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Together with everyone else,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.56,0:02:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,please save the Land of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.40,0:02:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I must tell you that the only person\Nwho was able to manage Enma in this country...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.67,0:02:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,...was Kozuki Oden\Nand no one before or since!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.45,0:02:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I am counting on you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, leave it to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.38,0:02:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,See you at the port!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.96,0:02:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.56,0:03:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait, Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.44,0:03:20.11,On Top,,0,0,0,,ISSHO
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.40,0:03:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,SEA AREA AROUND THE ENTRANCE OF THE NEW WORLD
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.45,0:03:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just a newcomer\Npicked through the International Military Draft,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.34,0:03:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,but since being appointed as a Navy admiral,\Nthere is something I want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.63,0:03:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.29,0:03:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The Seven Warlords.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.94,0:03:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The Four Emperors.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.55,0:03:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think will happen to\Nthe balance of power?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.43,0:03:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know. Who can \Ntell before we upset it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.73,0:04:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That vicious pirate was approved as a king of a country\Nunder the Seven Warlord system
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.66,0:04:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,and allowed to reign over this island\Nby none other than...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.04,0:04:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,...the World Government!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.54,0:04:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What I want to destroy is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.47,0:04:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,...the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.46,0:04:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We no longer need the \NSeven Warlords of the Sea!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.43,0:04:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Big News!\NAn Incident That Will Affect the Seven Warlords!"{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.15,0:04:43.28,On Top,,0,0,0,,MARIJOA
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.32,0:04:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The World Conference known as the Reverie.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.36,0:04:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's a grand conference of 50 representative kings and queens\Nheld every four years,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.48,0:04:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}representing more than 170 countries\Nthat are affiliated with the World Government.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.63,0:05:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Reverie was dismissed\Nin a state of great confusion as always,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.60,0:05:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and all the representatives went home.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.80,0:05:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.60,0:05:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...a week later...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.35,0:05:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee... I'm finally home-jamon...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.31,0:05:19.98,On Top,,0,0,0,,RYUGU CASTLE, RYUGU KINGDOM, FISH-MAN ISLAND
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.98,0:05:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy... The surface world is so far above...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.94,0:05:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, thank you for escorting us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.95,0:05:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy-sama's grandfather-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.66,0:05:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.25,0:05:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a pretty long trip, huh, Neptune?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.12,0:05:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be tired!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.54,0:05:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm exhausted-jamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.41,0:05:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Garp, stay here with us and rest well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.94,0:05:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe I'll have a cup of tea,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.48,0:05:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,but considering the situation,\NI can't stay here that long...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.23,0:05:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The Reverie always triggers big incidents.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.90,0:06:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,When 50 countries gather,\Na simple "Let's get along" won't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.73,0:06:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Each country has tons of \Nproblems of their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.86,0:06:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Large and mighty countries\Njust quietly stare at each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.87,0:06:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and let their proxies bicker...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.71,0:06:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,To them, resources and technologies\Nare a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.21,0:06:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They say that all countries are equal,\Nbut that's just lip service.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.14,0:06:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wealth and poverty and religious differences,\Nwon't allow them to be equal...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.40,0:06:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if they shake hands,\Nthey step on each other's foot with a grin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.66,0:06:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how many leaders there are\Nwho can speak for their
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.66,0:06:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,citizens and for other countries...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.53,0:06:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The round table must be weeping...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.81,0:07:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.\NThe conversations among the leaders were explosive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.43,0:07:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We're no exception, but quarrels between countries\Ncan't be solved so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.34,0:07:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If there is a long history,\Nthe conflict must have deeper roots.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.80,0:07:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if there is a disagreement,\Nas long as no blood is spilled, I call it peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.48,0:07:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But what happened this time is no good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.65,0:07:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a bit late to mention this,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.06,0:07:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,but there's actually one thing \Nthat I haven't told you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.82,0:07:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Right after the Reverie was dismissed and we set off,\Nan incident occurred,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.12,0:07:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,and I received the report aboard ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.75,0:07:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We the Navy will do our best to resolve it,\Nbut please don't be afraid of...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.21,0:07:44.29,On Top,,0,0,0,,JUSTICE
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.29,0:07:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,...the surface world as well as humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.59,0:07:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?\NGarp, what kind of report did you receive?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.93,0:07:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an incident concerning Alabasta Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.99,0:07:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Alabasta Kingdom...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.27,0:08:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Vivi-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.69,0:08:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Before all of this transpired...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.98,0:08:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}At the World Economic Journal\Nright after the Reverie was dismissed...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.36,0:08:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow! It's incident after incident!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.38,0:08:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't believe this many \Nthings happened at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.34,0:08:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen! Come up with the \Ngreatest heading ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.71,0:08:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, which one should make the front-page?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.04,0:08:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen! Someone has died!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.34,0:08:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The big obituary sells papers!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.02,0:08:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,--Then, that'll be the headline...\N--No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.61,0:08:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The resolution they passed is also good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.34,0:08:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But a murder attempt makes \Nyou excited as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.71,0:08:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.58,0:08:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's have two front pages!\NThe back page will have the same format as the front!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.95,0:08:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.08,0:08:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.53,0:08:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Express mail from the Government.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.57,0:08:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A check, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.00,0:08:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.41,0:08:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. It's an order to \Nmanipulate information.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.50,0:09:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But for which case?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.50,0:09:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hushing up this incident?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.70,0:09:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.71,0:09:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw this back in their faces!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.92,0:09:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.05,0:09:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.26,0:09:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Do what you're told, Morgans!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.24,0:09:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The secret agency, Cipher Pol?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.85,0:09:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You must obey orders\Nfrom the World Government.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.69,0:09:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.15,0:09:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate "Big News" Morgans!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.16,0:09:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,When did he sneak in?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.00,0:09:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir! Members of Cipher Pol are\Nthe Government officials!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.69,0:09:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I know!\NGuys, it's dangerous to stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.17,0:09:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's relocate!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.72,0:10:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I may be a miser,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.77,0:10:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm first and foremost a journalist!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.39,0:10:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I spin lies and make people dance.\NI'm a DJ of words!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.11,0:10:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I decide what to publish!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.11,0:10:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Morgans!\NYou got a call from King Wapol of Drum Kingdom...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.41,0:10:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,King Wapol?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.74,0:10:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What does he want?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.58,0:10:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, sounds like he has information to leak.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.81,0:10:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.09,0:10:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.53,0:10:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,A special report?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.69,0:10:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.02,0:10:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.78,0:11:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In addition to the incident that\Nthe Government failed to hush up,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.24,0:11:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the decision of the leaders made at the Reverie\Nand the incident that occurred there...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.84,0:11:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...became known throughout the world in a flash\Nand stunned people.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.17,0:11:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! What is this all about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.34,0:11:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be true!\NIt's just a story in the World Economic Journal, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.34,0:11:30.77,On Top,,0,0,0,,REVOLUTIONARY ARMY'S GENERAL HEADQUARTERS\NKAMABAKKA KINGDOM
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.11,0:11:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the WEJ!\NThat bird president must've written nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.31,0:11:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.69,0:11:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Sabo! That's impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.08,0:11:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't buy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.38,0:11:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.95,0:11:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,First, we must confirm the facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.34,0:11:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But all of them are out of contact...\NHow can we confirm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.92,0:11:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't true, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.09,0:11:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabo-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.21,0:12:01.51,On Top,,0,0,0,,ROYAL ESCORT SHIP, GOA KINGDOM
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.34,0:12:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,My lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.51,0:12:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He was in Marijoa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.97,0:12:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,B-Big Bro-sama?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.22,0:12:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to Makino?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.16,0:12:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,--The bar is closed today.\N--What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.10,0:12:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,There was so much news in the world...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.31,0:12:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I could use a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.61,0:12:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabo-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.70,0:12:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I just found out that he was alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.63,0:12:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me it's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.75,0:12:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabo!!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.63,0:12:43.38,DefaultLow,,0,0,0,,UNDERSEA PRISON IMPEL DOWN
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.13,0:12:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I never get bored with this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.14,0:12:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's getting interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.31,0:13:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.82,0:13:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's set sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.74,0:13:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather than just watch as the Navy takes it,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.32,0:13:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take it for myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.04,0:13:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now, back to the current action...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.83,0:13:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ring, ring, ring... Ring, ring, ring...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.13,0:13:24.63,On Top,,0,0,0,,OUTSKIRTS OF EBISU TOWN
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.88,0:13:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ring, ring, ring... Ring, ring, ring...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.97,0:13:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ring, ring, ring...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.14,0:13:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Clank.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.12,0:13:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me, Koby.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.48,0:13:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.65,0:13:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,--{\i1}I can't speak to you here.{\i0}\N--Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.94,0:13:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! "Sea"!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.09,0:13:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,"Fog"!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.03,0:13:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,As always, you're conscientious...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.68,0:13:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's a rule...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.05,0:13:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.87,0:14:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's something that I need to report...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.92,0:14:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...to you, Captain!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.38,0:14:06.67,DefaultLow,,0,0,0,,X. DRAKE - CAPTAIN OF "SWORD"\NNAVY HQ TOP SECRET SPECIAL FORCE
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.07,0:14:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Is that the situation out there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.90,0:14:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's too much to handle...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.03,0:14:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with all Navy soldiers in the world...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.33,0:14:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So just as we planned,\Nthe Navy won't get involved with what's going on over there.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.88,0:14:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They don't have enough soldiers...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.81,0:14:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that's fine.\NThe Land of Wano is not affiliated with the World Government.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.72,0:14:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now, about Big Mom arriving at Onigashima...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.65,0:14:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.93,0:14:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido and Big Mom have had a vendetta\Nfor so long...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.57,0:15:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy is expecting those two pirates\Nto ruin each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.16,0:15:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.61,0:15:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,As we expected,\NKaido and Big Mom were at each other's throats...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.24,0:15:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But they joined hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.28,0:15:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,W-W-W-W-What do you mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.04,0:15:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As for Straw Hat Luffy,\Nthere's been no word of a breakout.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.38,0:15:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The situation is at a standstill.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.56,0:15:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And there's one more thing.\NThis is unpleasant,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.93,0:15:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but I saw Cipher Pol Zero in the capital\Nthe other day.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.13,0:15:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Why are they in the Land of Wano?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.55,0:15:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope I'm wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.43,0:15:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,but that must mean the World Government is\Ndoing business...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.49,0:15:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,...with this Land of Wano\Nwhich is reigned over by a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.98,0:15:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,When I was made aware,\NI became stunned...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.23,0:15:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...for a few minutes.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.16,0:16:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}By the way, where are you now?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.85,0:16:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.33,0:16:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,To capture Pirate Empress, Boa Hancock...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.43,0:16:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,we're heading towards the Island of Women!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.01,0:16:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.36,0:16:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Those ships coming towards us\Ncrossing the Calm Belt are...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.89,0:16:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,...a Naval fleet?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.65,0:16:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Margaret!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.50,0:16:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is going to happen?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.78,0:16:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That news that spread across the world...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.74,0:16:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,They should've gotten rid of that damn thing\Na long time ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.55,0:16:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a mistake to team up with pirates...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.87,0:16:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,They're evil!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.41,0:16:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}For those who think all pirates are bad...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.42,0:16:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Those Government dogs will finally go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.26,0:16:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw that Pirate Empress, Hawk-Eye,\Nand Clown!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.13,0:16:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They're nothing but looters!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.35,0:17:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And for those who hate looters,\Nit's good news...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.35,0:17:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But I thought they did great\Nin the Paramount War!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.61,0:17:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The Reverie made the decision?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.65,0:17:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I think the Navy will go into action\Nimmediately...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.92,0:17:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.49,0:17:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,They were one of\Nthe three great powers in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.93,0:17:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}For those who knew\Nhow they did in the Paramount War,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.63,0:17:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and those who are concerned about\Nlosing the balance of the three great powers,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.47,0:17:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}it's a truly alarming situation.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.80,0:17:35.20,Italics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}One of the news stories \Non the latest Reverie,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.20,0:17:39.09,Italics,,0,0,0,,that stunned the people across \Nthe world the most was...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.55,0:17:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...the abolition of the Seven \NWarlords of the Sea system!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.81,0:17:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Seven Warlords of the Sea\Nare officially recognized pirates.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.66,0:17:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}While they're allowed to loot,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.04,0:17:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the Government uses them as deterrents\Nagainst other pirates.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.92,0:18:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The composition of the Seven Warlords\Nhas changed repeatedly with the times.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.04,0:18:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Crocodile.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.92,0:18:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He collided with the Straw Hats\Nover Alabasta Kingdom.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.92,0:18:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He was trying to take over the kingdom,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.80,0:18:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but he was defeated by Luffy\Nand expelled from the Seven Warlords.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.68,0:18:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The man who replaced Crocodile\Nand joined the Seven Warlords...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.11,0:18:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...was Marshall D. Teech.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.21,0:18:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However, after achieving his aim,\Nhe announced his resignation.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.11,0:18:40.13,Italics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"First Son of the Sea" Jimbei
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.13,0:18:43.43,Italics,,0,0,0,,who was opposed to the Paramount War \Nand became antagonistic to the Navy.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.43,0:18:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He, too, declared his resignation.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.87,0:18:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Gecko Moria.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.55,0:18:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This man who once got in the Straw Hats' way\Nwas also summoned for the Paramount War.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.22,0:19:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.51,0:19:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}after the war, he was attacked off guard\Nby an order from high up in the Government.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.73,0:19:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and was expelled.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.48,0:19:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Heavenly Demon Don Quixote Doflamingo...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.11,0:19:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}At the same time he governed \NDressrosa as its king,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.08,0:19:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}he was trafficking an artificial Devil Fruit, Smile,\Nas an influential underground broker.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.25,0:19:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.41,0:19:27.63,Italics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}he lost the battle over the kingdom\Nagainst Luffy
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.63,0:19:30.10,Italics,,0,0,0,,and the others and his \NWarlord title was revoked.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.50,0:19:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And Trafalgar Law.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.05,0:19:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He allied with the Straw Hats to take down Doflamingo\Nand was stripped of his title.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.22,0:19:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The four pirates who reign supreme\Nas if they're emperors.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.22,0:19:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Four Emperors.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.31,0:19:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Navy Headquarters\Nthat is trying to contain them.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.48,0:19:51.77,On Top,,0,0,0,,NAVY
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.77,0:19:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And the Seven Warlords of the Sea.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.35,0:19:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}These three great powers\Nhave kept the peace in the world.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.73,0:20:00.99,On Top,,0,0,0,,FOUR EMPERORS       NAVY\NSEVEN WARLORDS OF THE SEA
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.87,0:20:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.40,0:20:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}there are two kings who took\Nenormous losses from the Warlords.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.58,0:20:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}King Nefeltari Cobra of Alabasta Kingdom,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.54,0:20:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and Riku Doldo III of Dressrosa Kingdom.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.63,0:20:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They stood up for\Nthe abolition of the Seven Warlord system.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.50,0:20:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And after a heated debate at the Reverie,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.13,0:20:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}a large majority supported the proposition\Nand it was passed.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.76,0:20:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, the Seven Warlords of the Sea\Nnaturally forfeit all of their rights,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.32,0:20:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,and their connections with the World Government\Nare cut off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.03,0:20:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That means...!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.06,0:20:38.52,On Top,,0,0,0,,EMPTEE BLUFFS ISLAND, NEW WORLD
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.90,0:20:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Buggy!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.24,0:20:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're just another pirate!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.32,0:20:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not fair, you fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.45,0:20:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,A decision was made without telling us\Nand since we're no longer useful, you'll arrest us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.34,0:20:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no sense of justice whatsoever!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.59,0:20:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You being outwitted by Crocodile and Doflamingo\Nis none of my business!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.18,0:20:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take it out on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.10,0:21:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got the whole coast surrounded!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.55,0:21:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.22,0:21:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My whole life plan has been screwed up!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.68,0:21:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.06,0:21:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy's supposed to be on our side,\Nbut we're surrounded!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.19,0:21:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do, Mommy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.60,0:21:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.11,0:21:23.49,On Top,,0,0,0,,RUINS OF MUGGY KINGDOM, GLOOM ISLAND
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.11,0:21:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Surrender yourself now! "Hawk-Eye" Mihawk!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.94,0:21:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Surrender yourself!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.20,0:21:29.16,On Top,,0,0,0,,KUJA
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.70,0:21:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Snake Princess, we have a problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.58,0:21:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your title as a Warlord of the Sea\Nhas been stripped away!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.37,0:21:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Granny Nyon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.79,0:21:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,There are Navy ships off the coast!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.77,0:21:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.96,0:21:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They've already gone into action?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.55,0:21:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't panic!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.64,0:21:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Snake Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.89,0:21:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I think they're...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.02,0:21:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,...forgetting something!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.79,0:21:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no good, Chairman Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.58,0:21:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we run?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.61,0:22:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, we'll fight them in a flashy way!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.28,0:22:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Show some guts!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.78,0:22:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.75,0:22:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our Chairman Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.79,0:22:23.80,On Top,,0,0,0,,BUGGY THE GENIUS JESTER, BUGGY'S DELIVERY CHAIRMAN\NA FORMER WARLORD OF THE SEA
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.88,0:22:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Buggy! Buggy! Buggy! Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.80,0:22:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like they're not on our side anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.30,0:22:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so unforgivable...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.77,0:22:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Weevil! I give you approval \Nto take them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.62,0:22:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?! Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.82,0:22:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.23,0:22:43.19,On Top,,0,0,0,,EDWARD WEEVIL, WHITEBEARD JR. (SELF-PROCRAIMED)\NA FORMER WARLORD OF THE SEA
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.02,0:22:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,In the name of Whitebeard!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.77,0:22:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel a tremor of excitement...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.15,0:22:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.24,0:22:54.45,On Top,,0,0,0,,DRACULE MIHAWK, "HAWK-EYE"\NA FORMER WARLORD OF THE SEA
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.91,0:22:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,...since I was the one being chased.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.45,0:22:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We became the Seven Warlords of the Sea...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.33,0:23:03.34,On Top,,0,0,0,,BOA HANCOCK, PIRATE EMPRESS\NA FORMER WARLORD OF THE SEA
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.29,0:23:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,...because we were strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.35,0:23:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm counting on you, you guys!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.67,0:23:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}While you're doing that...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.93,0:23:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll get the hell out of here...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.43,0:23:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kaido and Big Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.22,0:23:23.25,Italics,,0,0,0,,Does that mean the vicious Rocks pirate\Ngroup which
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.25,0:23:25.32,Italics,,0,0,0,,once ruled the whole sea is back?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.32,0:23:26.99,Italics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The legend that Luffy's grandfather Garp
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.99,0:23:30.60,Italics,,0,0,0,,once allied with\Nthe King of the Pirates is now revealed!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.60,0:23:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The balance of power is lost!\NNo one can resolve the confusion now!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.45,0:23:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,On the next episode of One Piece!\N"A Legendary Battle! Garp and Roger!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.66,0:23:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna become the King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.46,0:23:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.46,0:23:48.46,On Top,,0,0,0,,
